# Diagnostics
lint/requireConcurrentReindex ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × REINDEX without CONCURRENTLY blocks all table access.
  
  i Use REINDEX CONCURRENTLY to rebuild the index without blocking reads and writes.
  


## Fix (safe): Add CONCURRENTLY
```
-- expect_lint/requireConcurrentReindex
reindex (verbose) table CONCURRENTLY users;
-- REINDEX SYSTEM doesn't support CONCURRENTLY, so there is no fix
-- expect_lint/requireConcurrentReindex
reindex system postgres;

```

lint/requireConcurrentReindex ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

